OL,3,GNEWSAFormer gin distillery cleared for
OL,4,Ause as exotic animal sanctuary
OL,5,
OL,6,FPlans to turn the site of a former gin
OL,7,Fdistillery in southern Scotland into a
OL,8,Fhome for exotic animals have been
OL,9,Fapproved.
OL,11,FThe Eclipse Animal Sanctuary (EAS)
OL,12,Flodged an application to convert the
OL,13,Fsite at Dalton in Dumfries and Galloway
OL,14,Fto house a variety of species including
OL,15,Fa wolfdog, lynx, turkey vulture and an
OL,16,FAmerican red fox.
OL,18,FThe small-scale development will cater
OL,19,Ffor about 20 rescue animals alongside
OL,20,Feight pet dogs.
OL,23,APub: 16-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,426,420,260,160,0,100
