OL,3,GNEWSAFormer gin distillery cleared for
OL,4,Ause as exotic animal sanctuary
OL,5,
OL,6,FDumfries and Galloway Council (DGC)
OL,7,Fapproved the plans with a number of
OL,8,Fconditions, including that the
OL,9,Fsanctuary was purely private and should
OL,10,Fnot be used for commercial purposes or
OL,11,Fas a visitor attraction.
